From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Nura rc4 displayport series <rc4-displayport@nura.invalid>
Date: Fri, 13 Nov 2026 12:00:03 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 49/50] ASoC: qdsp6: q6afe: tell port config, parameter and
 start failures apart

q6afe_port_start() sends the port configuration, optionally the TDM slot
mapping, and then the start command, and every failure logs the same "AFE
enable for port 0x%x failed" line.  q6afe_port_set_param_v2() logs it too.
When the DSP times out (-110) on a port the log cannot say which command it
never answered, and those point at different causes: a configuration the DSP
does not accept (firmware), a rejected parameter, or a start that blocks on
hardware.

Name them: "config", "TDM slot mapping", "start", and "set param" (with the
parameter id) in the set-param helper.

Signed-off-by: Nura rc4 displayport series <rc4-displayport@nura.invalid>
Nura-Category: upstream-fix
Nura-Origin: nura rc4 displayport series
Upstream-Status: not in mainline v7.2 (generic AFE enable message)
---
 sound/soc/qcom/qdsp6/q6afe.c | 10 +++++-----
 1 file changed, 5 insertions(+), 5 deletions(-)

diff --git a/sound/soc/qcom/qdsp6/q6afe.c b/sound/soc/qcom/qdsp6/q6afe.c
index 43d8773..182b68c 100644
--- a/sound/soc/qcom/qdsp6/q6afe.c
+++ b/sound/soc/qcom/qdsp6/q6afe.c
@@ -1158,8 +1158,8 @@ static int q6afe_port_set_param_v2(struct q6afe_port *port, void *data,
 
 	ret = afe_apr_send_pkt(afe, pkt, port, AFE_PORT_CMD_SET_PARAM_V2);
 	if (ret)
-		dev_err(afe->dev, "AFE enable for port 0x%x failed %d\n",
-		       port_id, ret);
+		dev_err(afe->dev, "AFE set param 0x%x for port 0x%x failed %d\n",
+		       param_id, port_id, ret);
 
 	return ret;
 }
@@ -1671,7 +1671,7 @@ int q6afe_port_start(struct q6afe_port *port)
 				       AFE_MODULE_AUDIO_DEV_INTERFACE,
 				       sizeof(port->port_cfg));
 	if (ret) {
-		dev_err(afe->dev, "AFE enable for port 0x%x failed %d\n",
+		dev_err(afe->dev, "AFE config for port 0x%x failed %d\n",
 			port_id, ret);
 		return ret;
 	}
@@ -1681,7 +1681,7 @@ int q6afe_port_start(struct q6afe_port *port)
 					AFE_PARAM_ID_PORT_SLOT_MAPPING_CONFIG,
 					AFE_MODULE_TDM, sizeof(*port->scfg));
 		if (ret) {
-			dev_err(afe->dev, "AFE enable for port 0x%x failed %d\n",
+			dev_err(afe->dev, "AFE TDM slot mapping for port 0x%x failed %d\n",
 			port_id, ret);
 			return ret;
 		}
@@ -1708,7 +1708,7 @@ int q6afe_port_start(struct q6afe_port *port)
 
 	ret = afe_apr_send_pkt(afe, pkt, port, AFE_PORT_CMD_DEVICE_START);
 	if (ret)
-		dev_err(afe->dev, "AFE enable for port 0x%x failed %d\n",
+		dev_err(afe->dev, "AFE start for port 0x%x failed %d\n",
 			port_id, ret);
 
 	return ret;
-- 
